flowchart LR
subgraph prepare "Prepare"
subgraph rehearse "Rehearse"
subgraph publish "Publish"
node bump rectangle "Bump versions" in prepare
node build rectangle "Build and sign" in prepare
node smoke rectangle "Smoke test" in prepare
node copy rectangle "Copy HOME" in rehearse
node upgrade rectangle "Upgrade daemon" in rehearse
node answer rectangle "Answer /daemon" in rehearse
node tag rectangle "Tag" in publish
node formula rectangle "Update formula" in publish
edge bump -> build solid none/arrow
edge build -> smoke solid none/arrow
edge copy -> upgrade solid none/arrow
edge upgrade -> answer solid none/arrow
edge tag -> formula solid none/arrow
edge smoke -> copy solid none/arrow
edge answer -> tag solid none/arrow
